sequenceDiagram
  actor B as Bodeguero
  participant V as InventarioController
  participant S as InventoryService
  participant DB as SQLite

  B->>V: Aprobar solicitud
  V->>S: ApproveRequestAsync
  S->>S: Validar Pendiente y stock suficiente
  alt Stock insuficiente
    S-->>V: Error
    V-->>B: No se puede aprobar
  else Stock OK
    S->>S: Descontar stock y marcar Aprobada
    S->>DB: UPDATE Materials y Requests
    S-->>V: Ok
    V-->>B: Solicitud aprobada
  end
